{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00874",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.42,
      "end_seconds": 13.04,
      "duration_seconds": 11.62,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. My diabetes check is due, but I also get tingling in my feet now, and I wanted to ask about that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.52,
      "end_seconds": 22.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "Good morning. Let's start with the tingling. Which part of the feet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.31,
      "end_seconds": 30.95,
      "duration_seconds": 6.64,
      "text": "The toes, mostly, on both sides. Like pins and needles."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.21,
      "end_seconds": 36.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.2,
      "end_seconds": 48.25,
      "duration_seconds": 8.05,
      "text": "Oh, I couldn't say. Maybe the spring? Or last winter. I really don't remember."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.76,
      "end_seconds": 55.82,
      "duration_seconds": 6.06,
      "text": "Is it there all the time, or does it come and go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.28,
      "end_seconds": 64.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "It's worse in the evening, when I'm sitting down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.93,
      "end_seconds": 72.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "Any weakness in the legs, or falls?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.55,
      "end_seconds": 79.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "No, nothing like that. My legs feel strong."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.1,
      "end_seconds": 88.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "Tell me about the diabetes medicines you're on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.89,
      "end_seconds": 103.67,
      "duration_seconds": 12.78,
      "text": "Metformin, 500 mg, twice a day. Then a small yellow one in the morning, I don't know the name. And the injection at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.27,
      "end_seconds": 111.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.56,
      "text": "Do you know how many units of the injection you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.68,
      "end_seconds": 120.53,
      "duration_seconds": 6.85,
      "text": "Twenty, I think. Or perhaps twenty-four. My wife does it, she writes it down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.64,
      "end_seconds": 133.71,
      "duration_seconds": 11.07,
      "text": "I'll ask you to bring her diary next time, then we'll be sure. Any other conditions besides the diabetes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.75,
      "end_seconds": 141.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Diabetes, for about ten years. That's all, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.97,
      "end_seconds": 151.1,
      "duration_seconds": 7.13,
      "text": "Have you noticed any trouble with your eyes, or sores on your feet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.04,
      "end_seconds": 160.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.79,
      "text": "No. My eyes are fine, and my feet have no sores."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.38,
      "end_seconds": 168.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.59,
      "text": "Good. I'll check your pulse, blood pressure and weight now. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.89,
      "end_seconds": 174.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Go ahead. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.1,
      "end_seconds": 194.8,
      "duration_seconds": 7.7,
      "text": "Pulse 74, blood pressure 134 over 80, weight 88 kilograms, temperature 36.6."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.85,
      "end_seconds": 201.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Is the weight all right? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.71,
      "end_seconds": 215.66,
      "duration_seconds": 10.95,
      "text": "It's about the same as last visit. I'd like to test the sensation in your feet with a thread in a moment. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.47,
      "end_seconds": 219.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Does it hurt? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.42,
      "end_seconds": 229.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "Not at all. Just tell me when you feel it. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.49,
      "end_seconds": 237.45,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "text": "Yes. Yes. Hmm, I didn't feel that one. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.1,
      "end_seconds": 249.36,
      "duration_seconds": 9.26,
      "text": "Thank you. I'd like to send blood tests for your sugar control, the HbA1c, and also your kidneys and B12."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.42,
      "end_seconds": 254.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "All right. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.98,
      "end_seconds": 265.49,
      "duration_seconds": 9.51,
      "text": "The tingling may well be early nerve damage from the diabetes, but I'd like the tests to say so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.77,
      "end_seconds": 271.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Is it serious? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.11,
      "end_seconds": 284.49,
      "duration_seconds": 11.38,
      "text": "It's common, and it often settles when the sugars are steady. Please check your feet daily, and wear shoes that fit well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.43,
      "end_seconds": 289.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "I will. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.11,
      "end_seconds": 300.45,
      "duration_seconds": 8.34,
      "text": "Come back in three weeks with your wife's diary, and I'll go through the results with you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.81,
      "end_seconds": 306.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Three weeks. Thank you, doctor. ~"
    }
  ]
}
